><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mphantom><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow></mphantom></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>∼</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"458\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"width: 0px; margin-right: -0.167em;\"><mjx-mspace style=\"margin-right: -0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx